        258,
        1951,
        1854,
        2076
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Your close cooperation in compliance with the provisions of this Memorandum and Memorandum #21 is anticipated in order to obtain maximum results in the formulation and processing of the City's 1954 legislative program.",
